  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7b7b5f2be6e8858da0564d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能在银河上\r\n跑步一定很舒服的吧──\r\n好想要在天上赛跑啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "152ae670c2b5b4fbbb057fc9bd754b9c1d070cabceffa9e46345dd1f2251e26f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79143a29da633db4227d2b22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n不给我点心跟胡萝卜\r\n我就要恶作剧了哦──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbeaaffffc5906572f975184dc1903dac617881ffc6af48c9893aa6e40022982",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29acd79a0da6208f9a5e7057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们来挂很大的袜子吧～♪\r\n让圣诞老人送我们一筐胡萝卜～♪\r\n……要多大？大概跟我一样大吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96069ae8168fc8c24214349ad63124b30d30a4ebf5a1796131d6ee3b8e3fa6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d4e5ead79cea3b0a3bf69b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼吼吼！等一下\r\n乌拉拉圣诞老人会来送礼物\r\n给好孩子训练员哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bb3cebb799e90fa2b7c497338ce8bee8a4c9b95570435d2347dd8b7d112556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5209d7332f1e9c4b393fda92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了赢了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c6d80b702e4db8095d21f1fd3dc3183bc3ad0700682a57e0f8b1b0b7bc9c206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66de44c86934828313fdf04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打──扫，打──扫♪\r\n赶快做完之后一起去吃\r\n跨年荞麦面吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3520b53817786d1a3c87a20b53345bb3af27bbfd7259a72d5b3c4df5b63589c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876f34660e9ffc4ef4deb697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\r\n大家一起为你准备了生日派对哦！\r\n我们一起庆祝吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de2d9e41efdb5a67511980ad5266e5c679a546b7d052ece66ea2128ad71cf65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46787a43099f091298fc38a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起去庆祝生日吧？\r\n我找到了很多胡萝卜很好吃的店哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3637b7ad6cec6da5c2770eecbf58b180a465d5a56f6d56952cd86e0f11b74c98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719eb88ebe3e37c5f2094e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经变成大人了，\r\n是不是可以跑更快了啊？\r\n你帮我计时看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a1559880dd3a7504183671097ea90562918f14c64c1a4d416a4a773e0aabd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8ad34958b0a18e776359b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要送我礼物啊！？\r\n太棒了──！最喜欢训练员了♪\r\n诶嘿嘿，要是每天都是生日就好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf9c785f46e71211c1682b644e3058e7b603040a243fa65e3178b064570ff97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51d7c8ccbb9ea97f1fdaf1c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有什么新的公告哦！\r\n好在意好在意啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9e9025e5b252c48526f078510c75cea4656c2d049b9949fb8ec3add053b9175",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7ed1fa0439c69f59a405d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～说是有礼物呢！\r\n会不会是胡萝卜啊？希望是胡萝卜啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9501acf79c6ada2e011f609f345c37fc28aad0458034259ff82a53b656ad5bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88848f5cf73aa63409276ec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成──♪\r\n我们去领奖励吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7416929710847206d36f29c91c02d76ea874ffba8b3a231ac1a5f61c13d1739f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef44b66a18800dbc102b7d64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是正在准备活动呢──\r\n感觉好期待哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91adb9918dcc9dc82aa040871afdfb9c5dbc5f4e149aa3067790e5ae17c55d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6bd4571bdfd8c720d626ad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来是很有趣的活动呢。\r\n我们赶快过去吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64411deca7de55a871af0c6f00ff0937d1a164b54800ddf804aa07fb2efb2ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e9090c9cee0a14eb3eb947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜呜，我输了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3187e66a49e3cdb8f244c43d8f6edd4c21c2ebce8cbb850a033bf0682bef39bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f6f59c09f7657c7e17c931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是叫赛马娘名鉴吗？\r\n说是这个东西升级了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ec698264b0568740bca992dd07ca8dcb93bf344c6049d492700f9a25504145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d08a6e4d902cd22202c67e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前呀，脖子的蝴蝶结我都绑不好。\r\n但现在绑得很漂亮了对吧？你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfee6fceb704a63b350ddd99e6b86fa6ae1dcbf9aa8ab87ada423dafa0314023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f31814c09ce56ef1c2930582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服呀，是妈妈买给我的！\r\n爸爸也说很可爱！\r\n所以乌拉拉非常喜欢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c263ab351b3955f99cf7b5a93f9cef7f2444dbae477640c93c9e4d060fb7398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9874e7a0dbf1e4373dec483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想跟训练员一起到很多地方去！\r\n然后呀，一起大玩特玩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e3a54a22caa197c03eef9ecd62cd374295f2d64cc68f17089d1ff1130d1227",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e391b1ede0ca9cf1bbe9b66f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都好厉害呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3970613c943d8df6cecd997631bc589f87de5f5ed12b313939f5a133ffeed6a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b9fc6f5667caa20e9cf7162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都很努力了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a95af92a334754fa10a4dd8e3020c1e79f9428b9667dbe2a264df980cad2ffd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16974dabe89751943e5a33cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜呜，我输了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3187e66a49e3cdb8f244c43d8f6edd4c21c2ebce8cbb850a033bf0682bef39bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed59c5ea4df9b4906b3326c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都好厉害呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3970613c943d8df6cecd997631bc589f87de5f5ed12b313939f5a133ffeed6a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
